      "doc": "Visible label for a `ForListboxGroup`. Generates a stable id and registers with its parent group so the group's `aria-labelledby` points at this element. Apply on whatever heading element fits the design (often `<div>` styled as a small caption — `<h3>`/`<h4>` if the surrounding document has a sensible heading hierarchy).",
