      "exportAs": "forListboxGroup",
      "host": {
        "role": "group",
        "[attr.aria-labelledby]": "labelId() || null"
      },
      "doc": "Optional grouping wrapper inside a `ForListbox`. Renders `role=\"group\"` and references the descendant `[forListboxGroupLabel]` (if any) via `aria-labelledby`. Options inside a group still register with the listbox normally, so keyboard navigation traverses across groups in DOM order without special handling.",
      "source": "listbox/listbox-group.ts",
