      "doc": "Headless implementation of the [WAI-ARIA Listbox pattern](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/listbox/). Implements `FormValueControl<string[]>` from `@angular/forms/signals` for `[formField]` auto-wiring.",
